# Performance Rules


## Frontend (Next.js)

- Prefer React Server Components — only add `"use client"` when the component needs interactivity
- Minimize client-side JavaScript bundles; move data fetching to server components or route handlers
- Set `Cache-Control` / `revalidate` headers on API responses and `fetch()` calls
- Use streaming (`loading.tsx`, `Suspense`) for pages with slow data sources

